nd plant faster to stop dozens of types of zombies dead in their tracks.","detailedDescription":"Zombies are invading your home, and the only defense is your arsenal of plants! Armed with an alien nursery-worth of zombie-zapping plants like peashooters and cherry bombs, you'll need to think fast and plant faster to stop dozens of types of zombies dead in their tracks. Obstacles like a setting sun, creeping fog and a swimming pool add to the challenge, and with five game modes to dig into, the fun never dies!\nFeatures\n                    \n\n• Play five game modes: Adventure, Mini-Games, Puzzle, Survival, plus the stress-free Zen Garden\n                    \n\n• Conquer all 50 levels of Adventure mode  through day, night, and fog, in a swimming pool and on the rooftop\n                    \n\n• Battle 26 types of zombies including pole-vaulters, snorkelers and Zomboni drivers\n                    \n\n• Earn 49 powerful perennials and collect coins to buy a pet snail, power-ups and more!\n                    \n\n• Open the Almanac to see all the plants and zombies, plus amusing facts and quotes\n                    \n\n• Browse Crazy Daves shop for special plants and tools to stem any zombie assault\n                    \n\n• Amazing graphics and soundtrack, plus a bonus music video\n                    \n\n• Infinite replayability: the game is never the same experience twice!\n                    \n\n• Unlock all the Steam Achievements","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590/header.jpg?t=1777394124"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777394124"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590/extras/3800a7c34b